      "NIFDC Cosmetic Safety and Technical Specifications (STSC 2015)": "限用 47 + 准用 4 类 / 47 restricted + 4 allowed categories",
      "NIFDC Technical Guidance for Children's Cosmetics": "2023-08-31",
